{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will simulate a chicken living on a farm in third person or first person, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with animal friends, feed them fruits, get wet, swim, swing on swings, unlock skins, play basketball, prank, annoy NPCs, peck, throw things, relieve stress, even destroy farms, and more ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_2.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals you have fed will follow the direction of your call, and a little mouse will become your good companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept farm tasks, complete farm stories about friendship, love, and family among the people on the farm, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_1.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the beloved chicken on the farm and win the embrace and praise of farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some tasks require completing prerequisites first, and after annoying NPCs, some will continue to dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm resources are limited and cannot be restored after being destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use boxes to transport fruits and improve efficiency... but don't get trapped under the boxes! If you do this, then struggle wildly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_3.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721350?t=1749882370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/d9c57213b0a301c52813b92426a2854c807148be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749882370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/e80ec8d9650874f834bdf311c38eb98e7d8bfd02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749882370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/e80ec8d9650874f834bdf311c38eb98e7d8bfd02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749882370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3729010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will simulate a chicken living on a farm in third person or first person, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with animal friends, feed them fruits, get wet, swim, swing on swings, unlock skins, play basketball, prank, annoy NPCs, peck, throw things, relieve stress, even destroy farms, and more ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_2.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals you have fed will follow the direction of your call, and a little mouse will become your good companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept farm tasks, complete farm stories about friendship, love, and family among the people on the farm, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_1.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the beloved chicken on the farm and win the embrace and praise of farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some tasks require completing prerequisites first, and after annoying NPCs, some will continue to dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm resources are limited and cannot be restored after being destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use boxes to transport fruits and improve efficiency... but don't get trapped under the boxes! If you do this, then struggle wildly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_3.gif?t=1749882370\" /></p>","developers":["ChickenMan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/ad38220db2e160780ac2fabf3b31fd016d53cca6/header.jpg?t=1749882370","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154281,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154281/movie480.mp4?t=1749597171","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154281/movie_max.mp4?t=1749597171"},"name":"FarmChickenPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154281/660dd831b8e4dcd68bf99c71ff861c218ad06a46/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749597171","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154281/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749597171","max":"http:/